### Page 133 of 291

```text
Capital Improvement Plan
City of Cheyenne, Wyoming
Department
1721 - Aquatics
'17/'18
'21/'22
thru
Contact
Parks and Recreation Director
 Description
Resurface the old swimming pool at Aquatics Center
Project #
AQ-17-001
 Justification
This needs to be done to sustain the usuability of the public pool.  The last resurfacing was completed in 2002.  the plaster surfacing that was used
has an estimated life span of 8-10 years.  The surfacing has exceeded its lifespan and is showing degradtion on the bottom of the pool with visible
erosion and staining.  Not resurfacing the pool can lead to leaking in the shell of the pool and sharp edges in the plaster presents a safety concern.
A new pool surfacing product called Diamondbrite would be used this time which has an extimated 12-14 year life span.
Useful Life
